{"4664310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Underking", "steam_appid": 4664310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go inside of the cave to mine deeper into the mountain in search of valuable ores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664310/extras/b7154fc4ce468f7e708b7fe0b2eb0a58.poster.avif?t=1785589378\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664310/extras/b7154fc4ce468f7e708b7fe0b2eb0a58.webm?t=1785589378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664310/extras/b7154fc4ce468f7e708b7fe0b2eb0a58.mp4?t=1785589378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extract</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cave is open only for a short period of time. Find as many resources as you can and take as many outside to convert them into coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664310/extras/da7f6858e0a72690115ea74ff886be02.avif?t=1785589378\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664310/extras_big/da7f6858e0a72690115ea74ff886be02.webp?t=1785589378 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade your coins for upgrades. These will help with faster mining, reaching further into the mountain and extraction of more resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664310/extras/0873e57167b6c036085edbb3ae28d3b7.avif?t=1785589378\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664310/extras_big/0873e57167b6c036085edbb3ae28d3b7.webp?t=1785589378 width=1560 height=366 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go inside of the cave to mine deeper into the mountain in search of valuable ores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664310/extras/b7154fc4ce468f7e708b7fe0b2eb0a58.poster.avif?t=1785589378\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664310/extras/b7154fc4ce468f7e708b7fe0b2eb0a58.webm?t=1785589378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664310/extras/b7154fc4ce468f7e708b7fe0b2eb0a58.mp4?t=1785589378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extract</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cave is open only for a short period of time. Find as many resources as you can and take as many outside to convert them into coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664310/extras/da7f6858e0a72690115ea74ff886be02.avif?t=1785589378\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664310/extras_big/da7f6858e0a72690115ea74ff886be02.webp?t=1785589378 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade your coins for upgrades. These will help with faster mining, reaching further into the mountain and extraction of more resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664310/extras/0873e57167b6c036085edbb3